# Intent: Owner decision 22: the network test is the host's, and a paired host sets the time zone. The unit no longer shows a network test button (More) or the vendor "Testing service" entry (Setup app); self.network.test stays for the host to call. The time zone picker (More, and the Setup app's Timezone entry) is shown only while no host address is saved; a paired host sets the zone with self.clock.set_zone.
# Placement: unit
# Upstream: firmware/main/hal and firmware/main/apps/app_setup (ours, and one entry of the stock Setup app)
# Check after a flash: More shows Version and Games but no Network test; with a host paired it shows no Time zone either; a unit with no saved host address still shows Time zone; self.network.test still answers; the Setup app lists no Testing service.
# Kconfig: MAIPAI_NETTEST description only (no change of default)
# Memory cost: none (less code: one button and one menu entry are gone); one saved-setting read when a menu is built.

